        "execSummary":  "Amazon Bedrock\u0027s platform footprint expanded significantly in September 2026, adding OpenAI and xAI models alongside new Claude variants, giving enterprise buyers direct model-switching flexibility within a single managed service. The serverless AgentCore runtime improvements—lower latency, pay-as-you-go—lower the cost and complexity bar for production agentic workloads. Native connectors to ServiceNow, Salesforce, and Zendesk remove a major integration friction point for support and operations teams. The key caveat: multi-vendor model availability on Bedrock deepens AWS lock-in at the orchestration layer even while appearing to offer choice.",
